[[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then loosen the bolt and disconnect the battery negative\n(-)  terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429395\">5530A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the alternator mounting (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052928.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the alternator mounting (1a) back in its housing and secure\nit tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ALTERNATOR SUPPORT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052929.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429395\">5530A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]